    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 id="area-title">Why this area has its own page</h2>
      <p>A 2014 Deccan Herald feature described Laxmi Nagar as a hub of coaching classes for CA students, and a 2009 report noted a local stretch of road being named Chartered Accountant's Lane. In 2019, India TV reported Delhi Fire Service inspections of coaching centres here. Other businesses work here too, and they follow the patterns on the {% routeLink "/locations/commercial-professional/", "commercial and professional areas" %} page. This page is about the coaching trade. The accounting points below are our general analysis.</p>
    </header>
